  "$comment": "THE declaration of omx-strip: the CLAP face, the LV2 face and the parameter header are generated from this file by tools/gen.mjs. Parameter order is append-only. The travels are omx-dsp’s declared ones (omx_contract_limits.h: TRIM_RANGE, HPF/LPF_FREQ_RANGE, OMX_GATE_*, EQ_*_RANGE, OMX_COMP_*), copied here at the omx-dsp pin. the ‘order’ parameter is the index of the stage permutation, lexicographic over (input, gate, eq, comp): 0 is the strip’s default order.",
